        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Schlage Barcelona Handleset With Collins Rose Inside</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis is a special ordered Barcelona Handleset. The interior trim features the Collins Rose with the Solstice Lever.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Handleset:</b> The deadbolt is thrown or retracted by a key from the outside or by a thumbturn on the inside. The latch is retracted by a thumbpiece from the outside and by a turn knob on the inside.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Dexter Barcelona Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>ANSI A156.5 Grade 3 Certification.</li>\r\n<li>Keying: 5-pin, C keyway with two key</li>\r\n<li>5 year finish warranty.</li>\r\n<li>25 year mechanical warranty.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit most standard door preparations.</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable through-bolt can move up and down 1-1/2\" to fit a variety of pre-existing holes</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Schlage Dexter Barcelona Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Zinc-based material.</li>\r\n<li>Interior Lever: Solstice Lever</li>\r\n<li>Interior Lever Rose: Collins</li>\r\n<li>Rage of Door Preparation: 4\" to 5-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Total Height: 18-1/4\" (with 5-1/2\" door prep)</li> \r\n<li>Exterior Total Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Center to Center Grip Range: adjustable 8-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt Escutcheon Height: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt Escutcheon Width: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Grip Escutcheon Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Height: 12\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Special Ordered Item. <b>No Returns</b></i>\r\n</p>",
